!Name: x-oscs-new-p001-019
!CThis is a collection of some oscillators that have
!Cbeen discovered since 1995. There are several parts:
!C oscs-new-p001-019
!C oscs-new-p020-035
!C oscs-new-p026-060
!C oscs-new-p061+
!C
!CExcluded are several categories of oscillators that
!Care adequately covered in other collections, such as
!Cguns, sparkers, and billiard tables.
!C
!CSome of these oscillator were improved in minor ways
!Csince the listed date of discovery, and are presented
!Chere in the improved form.
!C
!CAn asterisk [*] mean that this is a fairly small
!Cimprovement on, or variation of, a previously-known
!Coscillator.
!C
